    "json_number_decimal"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "instrument_map.csv maps BTC-PERPETUAL to instrument_id 101, price_exp -1, size_exp 0 (amount is USD notional in multiples of 10). ETH-PERPETUAL is unmapped -> defaults -9/-8, instrument_id null.",
    "label -> client_order_id (Deribit's only client-supplied id; '' -> null).",
    "Fee sign: negative = maker rebate (official example: liquidity M with fee -2.1E-7). Kept as-is (positive = cost already).",
    "Edits: 'replaced': true with the same order_id. Amount down at same price -> keeps priority; price change -> loses (order-management article). The importer infers amend_ack by diffing.",
    "cancel_reason edit_post_only_reject -> post_only_reject (importer choice: it is the post-only rule ending the order, although it fires on an edit rather than on entry).",
    "Order-notification last_update_timestamp -> record_time; trade timestamp -> match_time.",
    "Numbers are JSON numbers; 65000.5 / -3.1e-08 must be parsed as Decimal. qty_str '200' comes from the integer JSON token.",
    "order D: Deribit reports market orders with a protective price (2590.0); limit_px is kept but order_type=market so to_schedule excludes it."
  ],
